  "content": "\n\n<h2>需求</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jade 或 WTHIT</li>\n<li>Kotlin 函式庫。（需載入 <code>org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-stdlib</code>）<ul>\n<li>Fabric：<strong>Fabric Language Kotlin</strong>（<a href=\"https://github.com/FabricMC/fabric-language-kotlin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-language-kotlin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>）<ul>\n<li>（搭配 Jade 時）需要此模組的入口點提供者。</li></ul></li>\n<li>NeoForge：<ul>\n<li><strong>Kotlin for Forge</strong>：<a href=\"https://github.com/thedarkcolour/KotlinForForge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkotlin-for-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><strong>KotlinLangForge</strong>：<a href=\"https://github.com/btwonion/KotlinLangForge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkotlin-lang-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlinlangforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>範例</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生物</th>\n<th>Jade</th>\n<th>WTHIT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>村民</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ESa9RivE/images/ea127410a4c913adb12de3104699331b622ae604.png\" alt=\"Jade 中村民的提示資訊\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ESa9RivE/images/70f7e4e789e620cbdbe0359bb6d95bc0ce207b3e.png\" alt=\"WTHIT 中村民的提示資訊\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>悅靈</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ESa9RivE/images/7a91a6720b21355b44afe5ad56e0800403755981.png\" alt=\"Jade 中悅靈的提示資訊\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ESa9RivE/images/592b29986716a35b3d124c6ab99461af7cc6b629.png\" alt=\"WTHIT 中悅靈的提示資訊\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>豬布林</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ESa9RivE/images/1dff1fc6d77026ea48501fdacc7adfcb5ac4ee7a.png\" alt=\"Jade 中豬布林的提示資訊\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ESa9RivE/images/769826344a028eb76f56cb381a9e277cdf587c2f.png\" alt=\"WTHIT 中豬布林的提示資訊\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
